    "background_story": "Munchkin was a curious and adventurous cat who lived with her owner, a botanist, in a cozy little house surrounded by a lush garden. One day, while exploring the garden, Munchkin stumbled upon a peculiar plant with leaves that seemed to shimmer in the sunlight. Unbeknownst to her, the plant was Salvia divinorum, a rare species containing the potent compound salvinorin. As she sniffed and nibbled on the leaves, Munchkin began to exhibit strange behavior, as if she was experiencing vivid, dreamlike visions. Her owner, fascinated by the cat's reaction, started studying the effects of salvinorin on feline behavior. Munchkin became an unlikely research partner, helping to uncover the mysteries of this powerful compound and its potential applications in veterinary medicine.",
